"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:15:08Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-02T23:20:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T09:18:13Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nUnable to reproduce in Godot 4.6 stable\nAble to reproduce in 4.7 stable.\nAble to reproduce in 4.8 dev4 (commit ebbf577a04)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9571) - AMD Ryzen 7 2700X Eight-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.93 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe editor Viewport no applies the saved the View Z-Far when opening a scene created that session. Every time a scene is re-opened within the same session it was created, the View Z-Far will need to be manually edited.\n\nExpected behavior is that the View Z-Far is persisted and automatically applied when a scene is opened.\n\nI believe this is a regression introduced in Godot 4.7, and is still present in more recent builds like 4.8 previews.\n\nNote that this behavior is only for re-opening scenes within the same session. Closing and reopening the Godot editor appears to fix it. That is to say, scenes that were saved with 4.7 appear to still have the correct Z-Far data, it is just not applied correctly to the editor's viewport until the editor is fully restarted.\n\n<img width=\"258\" height=\"295\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/46c84ca0-71cb-4b34-9c9e-7904929c29fc\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new scene\n- View -> Settings -> View Z-Far -> Change from default of 4,000 to 512,000\n- Close Scene\n- Reopen Scene\n- In Godot 4.6, the adjusted value of 512,000 is persisted. In Godot 4.7 and onwards, the value is reset to the default of 4000.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[z-far-bug-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31761231/z-far-bug-mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123122/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123122/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}